# Launcher split, move L7 (docs/engine/modularization_plan.md, Part C section 13): member moderation for servers and
# group chats (launcher/main.cpp 5933-6132 at the base) -> launcher/MemberModerationUI.hpp / .cpp, and the open group
# conversation, DrawGroupConversation (6133-6956) -> launcher/GroupConversation.hpp / .cpp.
# Check it with (on the move commit):
#   python3 scripts/check_pure_move.py --base HEAD~1 --head HEAD --source launcher/main.cpp \
#       --dest launcher/MemberModerationUI.hpp --dest launcher/MemberModerationUI.cpp --dest launcher/GroupConversation.hpp \
#       --dest launcher/GroupConversation.cpp --dest launcher/LauncherShared.hpp --rules docs/engine/moves/L7_group_conversation.rules
# The `mm` namespace alias moved unchanged into MemberModerationUI.hpp. The chat's message types (StarredMsg, SchedMsg,
# ChatFileInfo, ChatPollInfo, ChatInviteInfo, ChatFwd, ChatVoiceInfo, ChatPinRef, ChatTbBtn) and the constant
# kChatThemeCount moved unchanged from main.cpp into LauncherShared.hpp: main.cpp's chat and the group conversation
# both use them.
#
# main.cpp: `static` dropped on what the moved code uses (declared in LauncherShared.hpp); default arguments of
# OutboxSend, VoiceRecordingFor, DrawVoiceMicButton and ComposerPlusButton move to the declarations; kChatWinBg goes
# from `static const` to `extern const` (one definition); DrawStar's forward declaration is replaced by the header.
# The moved code: `static` dropped on what main.cpp calls (declared in MemberModerationUI.hpp / GroupConversation.hpp).
